WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.836
CTEs are mainly a query-organization tool PostgreSQL

00:00:05.863 --> 00:00:12.521
can sometimes inline or fold a non-recursive CTE
into the surrounding query In

00:00:12.547 --> 00:00:18.460
other situations materialization behavior can matter
The practical

00:00:18.486 --> 00:00:23.670
lesson for this course is simple use CTEs for
clarity and inspect the execution plan

00:00:23.697 --> 00:00:29.295
when performance matters Do not assume WITH
automatically makes a query

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:29.900
faster
